WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.033
Sam: We’re here, Lucky! We’re at the farm!

2
00:00:11.034 --> 00:00:17.795
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

3
00:00:17.796 --> 00:00:25.076
Dad: Sounds like everyone is happy!

4
00:00:25.077 --> 00:00:32.074
Dad: It’s great to see you, Dan.

5
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:35.046
Mom: Sam, do you remember Karen?

6
00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:39.796
She's your cousin. Sam:

7
00:00:39.797 --> 00:00:42.152
Hi, Karen. Karen:

8
00:00:42.153 --> 00:00:45.604
Hi, Sam. Sam:

9
00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:56.351
There are so many animals here! Dan:

10
00:00:56.352 --> 00:01:00.471
Let's go on a tour of the farm! Sam:

11
00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:05.100
Can Lucky come too? Dan:

12
00:01:05.101 --> 00:01:13.876
Of course. Sam:

13
00:01:13.877 --> 00:01:18.039
These cows are big!

14
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:24.536
Karen: They give us lots of fresh milk.

15
00:01:24.537 --> 00:01:27.345
Dan: Here you go, Lucky.

16
00:01:27.346 --> 00:01:36.949
Lucky: Woof!

17
00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:41.644
Sam: Do the chickens lay lots of eggs?

18
00:01:41.645 --> 00:01:48.812
Dan: Yes. Put your hand under this hen.

19
00:01:48.813 --> 00:01:59.156
Sam: Wow! I found an egg!

20
00:01:59.157 --> 00:02:03.394
Dan: The sheep need to go into their pen.

21
00:02:03.395 --> 00:02:25.410
Karen: Watch this, Sam. Buddy!

22
00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:31.819
Sam: Wow!

23
00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:40.547
Karen: My dog knows how to work.

24
00:02:40.548 --> 00:02:49.194
Sam: So does Lucky. We’ll show you!

